# Sysmon Configuration Error | T1564 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/sysmon/sysmon_config_modification_error.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=255 (Description IN ("*Failed to open service configuration with error*", "*Failed to connect to the driver to update configuration*")) NOT ((Description="*Failed to open service configuration with error*" Description="*Last error: The media is write protected.*") OR (Description="*Failed to open service configuration with error*" Description="*Last error: Média protégé en écriture.*") OR Description IN ("*Failed to open service configuration with error 19*", "*Failed to open service configuration with error 93*"))
